"Voices" cards on the home page
- These are excerpts from conversations between Yan Canny and several AI models, and from
  chats with friends, on 8 November 2026. Model answers are quoted as written and do not
  represent the views of the models' developers; model names only identify the source.
  Friends' answers are shown with their consent under nicknames. Translations into other
  languages were made for this project.

